The present petitions have been filed by the petitioners with the following prayers:
"3.1 allow the instant petition;
3.2 graciously be pleased to quash the impugned FIR bearing Crime No. 19 of 2025 dated 20.01.2025 registered at Police Station Pandri, District Raipur (C.G.) for commission of alleged offence punishable under Sections 120-B, 409, 420 of the IPC and the consequential criminal proceeding, if any, qua the petitioners herein in the interest of justice."
